# <engine> <sha256 of SHA256SUMS in release engine-<engine>> [<sha256 of SHA256SUMS.extra>]
# The optional third field pins SHA256SUMS.extra, which checksums the release's
# overlay-extra-<engine>.tar and .txt. A line without it installs no extra
# files, exactly as before. Dropping the third field from a line therefore
# silently stops installing that release's extra files; nothing fails.
# A release's files can be replaced in place, and SHA256SUMS comes from the
# same release, so the action pins SHA256SUMS itself here. Republishing a
# release means updating its line in a reviewed PR.
